                "text": "The term **\"IntelGate\"** (or **Intel's CPU Crisis**) is a colloquial label used to describe a massive corporate and hardware scandal involving **Intel's 13th-generation (Raptor Lake) and 14th-generation (Raptor Lake Refresh) desktop processors**"
