                "end_index": 816,
                "part_index": null,
                "text": "The Core Issue: 13th and 14th-Gen CPU Instability (2024)\nBeginning in late 2023 and escalating dramatically in mid-2024, gamers, system builders, and server operators noticed that high-end Intel desktop CPUs (particularly the Core i9-13900K and i9-14900K) were experiencing frequent, unexplained crashes, out-of-memory errors, and Blue Screens of Death (BSOD)"
              },
              "rendered_parts": null
