              ],
              "segment": {
                "start_index": 2116,
                "end_index": 2362,
                "part_index": null,
                "text": "To salvage its reputation, Intel eventually issued a **microcode patch** to cap voltage limits, established new \"Intel Default Settings\" for motherboard BIOS, and **extended the warranties of affected 13th and 14th-gen desktop CPUs by two years**"
              },
              "rendered_parts": null
            },
            {
              "confidence_scores": null,
              "grounding_chunk_indices": [
                14,
                5
              ],
              "segment": {
                "start_index": 2366,
                "end_index": 2624,
                "part_index": null,
                "text": "Nevertheless, the financial impact of the scandal\u2014combined with missing the AI hardware boom\u2014contributed to a massive drop in Intel's stock, the announcement of 15,000 layoffs in late 2024, and the abrupt resignation of CEO Pat Gelsinger in December 2024"
              },
              "rendered_parts": null
            },
            {
              "confidence_scores": null,
              "grounding_chunk_indices": [
