              "segment": {
                "start_index": 2811,
                "end_index": 2993,
                "part_index": null,
                "text": "**The Pentium FDIV Bug (1994):** Intel's first major hardware scandal involved a mathematical flaw in the original Pentium processor that caused it to make errors in complex division"
