                "part_index": null,
                "text": "**Meltdown and Spectre (2018):** When major hardware security flaws affecting nearly all modern CPUs (predominantly Intel's architecture) were revealed in 2018, some media outlets and tech enthusiasts briefly called the security crisis \"Intelgate\""
